				<translations>
					<translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans">
						<text for="line-68a6c0cf-c3d2-4c11-868b-f644997117e1">跨越几亿年的历史</text>
						<text for="line-99cee1db-c17b-4b54-a93f-ed91afce7d70">回答了哟Shine</text>
						<text for="line-d8f3ad56-3af8-4566-8c68-4af955a6dd9d">比火焰更热的思念</text>
						<text for="line-cbafb3ed-1652-4174-b182-e64b03de4199">飞翔吧我的冈格尼尔</text>
						<text for="line-e34826c2-8d65-4c93-8794-3af58c99b0b3">向着最快最短的直线</text>
						<text for="line-9e5410c7-37c5-4956-91b9-a9427093cf88">愿与你一同见证</text>
						<text for="line-e3dfa3e7-8b7e-466e-941d-3ff66c1f7f6d">现在一起抬头仰望吧</text>
						<text for="line-336a45f1-f041-43c0-aa82-ed6dd69c12b2">竭尽全力传达着“你绝不是孤身一人”</text>
						<text for="line-d51a8e71-cbd0-4e35-bbbe-cf640d656aaf">接下来!欢笑吧...!</text>
						<text for="line-ea09016b-b850-4df4-882e-9a358b6a2de2">歌声仍在这个世界上</text>
						<text for="line-cc693118-8073-49a0-8524-e3858c8e0e31">无论多少次我都会重新站起来</text>
						<text for="line-fffb5efe-390a-46d4-94a9-6d87b8a486de">看一看吧？</text>
						<text for="line-79be45d9-4aaf-4ab6-a9f8-73f156fa6ae1">如此这般闪着光辉</text>
						<text for="line-b83610a9-397d-41dc-b3b0-ae979ae359aa">没有丝毫虚假</text>
						<text for="line-a884789e-5939-4b4e-b04e-4a9ef8b24472">“未来终有一天 每个人能够彼此相连”</text>
						<text for="line-2cdd7f61-d022-4831-9fb3-a6b64c80ae97">得到的话语 绝对</text>
						<text for="line-fcf30699-fa35-4248-912b-a1df2ac595bd">全开马力 让爱的挽歌奏响轰鸣</text>
						<text for="line-a0315195-469c-4093-8ff3-ca57a0e2d135">接下来!把勇气与</text>
						<text for="line-5f050fce-7127-430e-b913-d16741208bcb">全部的一切 都凝聚到一起吧</text>
						<text for="line-fe81312a-9a8b-4fdb-8588-f939281ca4a7">你与我、大家、大家、</text>
						<text for="line-ea70dafe-fdeb-418d-b114-ba7a8a03d61a">走过的、足迹里、</text>
						<text for="line-8c14390e-7d0c-4bb4-85ba-01407165671f">会盛开怎样的花呢?</text>
						<text for="line-5958da04-f4f4-4936-ad63-6f7443b90222">哭泣着、欢笑着、由此诞生的</text>
						<text for="line-94e35d36-bf61-4172-a793-887891c00d46">眼泪、泪水…、</text>
						<text for="line-079a7eb3-b7db-440a-854e-b86ff0fe59df">一定 会化作美丽的虹色的花朵</text>
						<text for="line-e2bcedce-9697-48e0-8ac3-3263ba7dd634">绽放并高歌…!</text>
						<text for="line-17b33b8e-77bc-4574-8864-b83b047414cb">竭尽全力传达着“你绝不是孤身一人”</text>
						<text for="line-b23c1292-6307-4c76-98f7-9597e5e158bd">接下来! 直至我们重逢的那天</text>
						<text for="line-502677e7-1974-401e-8853-51bd644ec693">带着笑颜说“再见”吧</text>
						<text for="line-ce396dc1-8c61-4ad9-ab2a-b00f7ebf8a88">一定…一定会…</text>
						<text for="line-0d396efc-77c4-482f-b3a2-133fbde2d6c5">这份心中的疑问</text>
						<text for="line-79642f4c-8bd3-4732-bdd1-f43fc438d78b">以钢铁的雷鸣</text>
						<text for="line-360caad9-a2f1-44e0-bded-cb5519ec6da8">那闪耀的朝阳</text>
						<text for="line-f5e882c5-b200-424b-9a83-e0576a1638d9">只有一点也好 那来时的道路</text>
						<text for="line-2a93d7cb-aa0a-4062-a199-c63b689c7c25">积累起来的故事</text>
						<text for="line-0c60a623-7b84-4365-b24c-916c841b1acc">会编织着梦想</text>
						<text for="line-9e5410c7-37c5-4956-91b9-a9427093cf88">
							<span ttm:role="x-bg">(见证)</span>
						</text>
						<text for="line-e3dfa3e7-8b7e-466e-941d-3ff66c1f7f6d">
							<span ttm:role="x-bg">(现在)</span>
						</text>
						<text for="line-06c502e1-7faf-4698-8b1f-1dfaa3c73000">响彻吧 传达吧 歌唱吧</text>
						<text for="line-06c502e1-7faf-4698-8b1f-1dfaa3c73000">
							<span ttm:role="x-bg">(响彻吧 传达吧 歌唱吧)</span>
						</text>
						<text for="line-dcea8c8b-ca25-4e2a-ab94-792c80672a09">响彻吧 传达吧 歌唱吧</text>
						<text for="line-dcea8c8b-ca25-4e2a-ab94-792c80672a09">
							<span ttm:role="x-bg">(响彻吧 传达吧 歌唱吧)</span>
						</text>
						<text for="line-256e88e9-a5a7-4f4c-9cc3-19329f3db82f">从重要的朋友那里</text>
						<text for="line-2cdd7f61-d022-4831-9fb3-a6b64c80ae97">
							<span ttm:role="x-bg">(绝对)</span>
						</text>
						<text for="line-0c60a623-7b84-4365-b24c-916c841b1acc">
							<span ttm:role="x-bg">(梦想)</span>
						</text>
						<text for="line-1a6ef1b2-66b2-4467-af61-132bd2fa38a7">响彻吧 传达吧 歌唱吧</text>
						<text for="line-1a6ef1b2-66b2-4467-af61-132bd2fa38a7">
							<span ttm:role="x-bg">(响彻吧 传达吧 歌唱吧)</span>
						</text>
						<text for="line-ad59a701-02dc-43da-9233-ed7931d81684">响彻吧 传达吧 歌唱吧</text>
						<text for="line-ad59a701-02dc-43da-9233-ed7931d81684">
							<span ttm:role="x-bg">(响彻吧 传达吧 歌唱吧)</span>
						</text>
						<text for="line-9fd33cea-bae2-462b-aee4-1eb1ba0c331b">响彻吧 传达吧 歌唱吧</text>
						<text for="line-9fd33cea-bae2-462b-aee4-1eb1ba0c331b">
							<span ttm:role="x-bg">(响彻吧 传达吧 歌唱吧)</span>
						</text>
						<text for="line-48db3e36-4e9f-4b56-b373-198747d4d0d9">响彻吧 传达吧 歌唱吧</text>
						<text for="line-48db3e36-4e9f-4b56-b373-198747d4d0d9">
							<span ttm:role="x-bg">(响彻吧 传达吧 歌唱吧)</span>
						</text>
					</translation>
				</translations>
			</iTunesMetadata>
		</metadata>
	</head>
